flowchart LR
    A[loan_approval_data.csv] --> B[Schema validation]
    B --> C[Feature selection<br/>Age Income LoanAmount CreditScore]
    C --> D[Target selection<br/>Approved]

    D --> E[Train/test split]
    E --> F[Baseline logistic regression]
    E --> G[XGBoost classifier]

    F --> H[Baseline probabilities]
    G --> I[XGBoost probabilities]

    H --> J[Default metrics]
    I --> K[Default threshold 0.50 metrics]

    I --> L[Threshold scan from 0.01 to 0.99]
    L --> M[Constraint: precision >= 0.90]
    M --> N[Choose threshold with best recall]
    N --> O[Policy-threshold metrics]

    O --> P[ROC curve]
    O --> Q[Confusion matrix]
    O --> R[metrics.json]